  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Blue green colour is due to formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>BO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. Copper gives blue green colour in borax bead test. Reactions which lead to formation of borax bead:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi></mover><mi>CuO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CuO</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>BO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>"
  }
